{
  "id": "spell-book",
  "name": "fantasy",
  "category": "魔法书页",
  "description": "一本魔法书上撕下的一页",
  "trigger": {
    "type": "random",
    "probability": 0.015,
    "conditions": []
  },
  "variables": {
    "spellName": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "魔法名称"
    },
    "school": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "魔法学派",
      "options": [
        "元素",
        "死灵",
        "幻术",
        "防护",
        "召唤"
      ],
      "default": "元素"
    },
    "caster": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "施法者"
    },
    "content": {
      "type": "text",
      "maxLength": 250,
      "description": "魔法内容/咒语"
    },
    "warning": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "使用警告"
    },
    "date": {
      "type": "date",
      "description": "记录日期"
    }
  },
  "promptTemplate": "请生成一张「fantasy」的内容。\n\n背景信息：\n- 当前场景：{{scene}}\n- 发送者：{{sender}}\n- 接收者：{{recipient}}\n\n要求：\n1. 内容要符合该卡片的风格和情境\n2. 语气要自然、有代入感\n3. 字数控制在100-300字之间\n\n请直接输出内容，不要有其他说明。",
  "style": {
    "theme": "handwritten",
    "colors": [
      "#2c1810",
      "#6b2020",
      "#3a2020"
    ],
    "mood": "一本魔法书上撕下的一页"
  },
  "rarity": "rare",
  "collectible": true
}